      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMaxDirector\n\nLay out shots on the **Director** node's timeline; it compiles them into the single\nstructured prompt MiniMax H3 reads, and snaps the clip to a length H3 accepts\n(`length % 17 == 5` at 24 fps).\n\n- `prompt` and `report` outputs show exactly what was built and what the linter thinks.\n- Wire an image to `ref_image` and refer to it as `<Picture 1>` in the shot text.\n- Models: the H3 bundle (ref2va unet, Qwen3-VL text encoder, video + audio VAEs).\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
